 "words": 256,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "He was about thirty when the work began",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 1.9,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "As it was supposed, he carried the name",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 1.65,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Son of Heli, son of Matthat, son of Levi",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.73,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Walking the path that the ancestors knew",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.78,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "From Melchi to Jannai, the line is drawn",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 1.01,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Through Joseph and Mattathias, the story grows",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.67,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Amos and Nahum, Esli and Naggai",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 1.16,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Maath and Mattathias, names in the snow",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.68,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The son of Joanan, the son of Rhesa",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 1.37,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "The son of Zerubbabel, the son of Shealtiel",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 1.38,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "The son of Neri, the link in the chain",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 1.05,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "From David's throne to the Messiah's name",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.21,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Zerubbabel led the people home",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.97,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "From Babylon's shadow, from exile and grief",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.01,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He rebuilt the altar for the God of Israel",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.61,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Offering burnt offerings, keeping the belief",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.58,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Jeshua and the priests stood side by side",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 1.35,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Following the Law of Moses, the man of God",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.87,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Shealtiel stood with his kinsmen in the work",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.44,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Preserving the hope of the ancient cord",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.06,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The son of Joanan, the son of Rhesa",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.87,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The son of Zerubbabel, the son of Shealtiel",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 1.28,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "The son of Neri, the link in the chain",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 1.15,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "From David's throne to the Messiah's name",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.21,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "After the exile, Jechoniah is named",
